    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the initial button in Cycle 0, the game changed to a twin button system with challenges, decoys and cursor upgrades in Cycle 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.poster.avif?t=1755773035\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.webm?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.mp4?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle 2 added a new rhythm challenge, dark mode and hub world overhaul while Cycle 3 completely changed the core gameplay to WASD controls, aquatic-themed graphics, a new swarm challenge and a multi-stage boss fight against MEGANOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.poster.avif?t=1755773035\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.webm?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.mp4?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Cycle 4 bring to the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Co-Development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today it\u2019s a clicker, tomorrow a platformer, puzzle, RPG, or something entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid Expansions. Purchase early and enjoy all future updates forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just playing, you\u2019re designing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time feedback via development live streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid update cycles mean the game never feels the same twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, climb, design! Let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a <strong>No</strong> into a resounding\u00a0<strong>Yes</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the initial button in Cycle 0, the game changed to a twin button system with challenges, decoys and cursor upgrades in Cycle 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.poster.avif?t=1755773035\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.webm?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.mp4?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle 2 added a new rhythm challenge, dark mode and hub world overhaul while Cycle 3 completely changed the core gameplay to WASD controls, aquatic-themed graphics, a new swarm challenge and a multi-stage boss fight against MEGANOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.poster.avif?t=1755773035\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.webm?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.mp4?t=1755773035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Cycle 4 bring to the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Co-Development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today it\u2019s a clicker, tomorrow a platformer, puzzle, RPG, or something entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid Expansions. Purchase early and enjoy all future updates forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just playing, you\u2019re designing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time feedback via development live streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid update cycles mean the game never feels the same twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, climb, design! Let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a <strong>No</strong> into a resounding\u00a0<strong>Yes</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "A blank slate for players to cooperatively design, starting with just a button and a leaderboard. Compete with your high score or win the heart of the crowd with your idea to make it define the next update's gameplay. Watch your designs take shape almost daily as they are implemented live on stream.",
